    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "Dr. {@nickname}...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "I... I didn't mean to... I...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_wild_a",
        "width": 1,
        "height": 1,
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma"
    },
    {
        "text": "The fog has dispersed.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "text": "We've received communications from the L.G.D. They found more Reunion movements.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "text": "They're currently tracking down one enemy, described as female with white hair--",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
        "name2": "char_136_hsguma",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Amiya, Ch'en told me that she wanted you to...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog",
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#4"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
        "name2": "char_136_hsguma",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "text": "...You don't look so good.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
        "name2": "char_136_hsguma",
        "focus": -1
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "Let me handle it.",
        "values": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma"
    },
    {
        "text": "Well...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'll leave her to you, Dr. {@nickname}.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "text": "It'd be ideal to leave within 5 minutes.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Dr. {@nickname}...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#5",
        "focus": -1
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "Are you scared?;...Do you not like this power you have?;Amiya, it's not your fault.",
        "values": "1;2;3"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#6"
    },
    {
        "text": "Huh...? I...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "Doctor... it's not like I'm afraid or anything...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Of course, I'm afraid... of losing you again... That's why...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "I just... didn't mean to...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#6"
    },
    {
        "text": "I... I just don't know...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't know if I should be saying this, but...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "It shouldn't... only be hurting other people.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't want you to see me like this, up close...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "...I took someone's life.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 3
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "I feel no regret.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "No, what I mean is...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "I will always use my power for your sake. No matter what kind of burden he was carrying, I don't regret killing him.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "But... there should have been a better way.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "He died because... I wasn't able to find it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "And that... is eating me up inside.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't want...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't want you to see this side of me, {@nickname}.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Even though I've always talked about freeing the Infected from pain and suffering...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "But when matters the most, I have to persuade myself, again and again, that it's justified to take the life of another Infected.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "I am truly pathetic.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": "1;2;3"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
        "focus": -1
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "Amiya, at least you protected me.",
        "values": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "...This was my duty.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#6"
    },
    {
        "text": "I understand.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I never believed that anything was already determined by fate.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "But, no matter what happens... no matter what I become...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'll always protect you, Doctor.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "I promise.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "initr": 2,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
        "name2": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "No!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "text": "You all go first!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "text": "I need to... I need to bring Skullshatterer back!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
        "name2": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Are you insane?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "text": "That's suicide... If you're going, we're all going together!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
        "name2": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "All right!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "text": "I can't leave him alone out there...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
        "name2": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Let's go then!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "initr": 2,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma"
    },
    {
        "text": "Why...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "text": "Why is Reunion... turning back around?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "text": "What are they doing...?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Madam Hoshiguma! Fall back!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma"
    },
    {
        "text": "L.G.D., don't panic!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "text": "Prepare for enemy attack!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$p_imp_blunt_h",
        "volume": 0.7
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 1,
        "xstrength": 10,
        "ystrength": 12,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1002_nsabr_2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Cover! Cover me!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "text": "That woman...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's impossible... We can't get past her shield!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "text": "Quick! Wrap around, before they have a chance to react...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "text": "We have to get to Skullshatterer... and bring him...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "text": "And bring him home!!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma"
    },
    {
        "text": "Rhodes Island! They're changing their target, watch out!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh no!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Madam Hoshiguma! Watch your right!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma"
    },
    {
        "text": "Huh...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$p_imp_grenade_n",
        "volume": 0.7
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 1,
        "xstrength": 10,
        "ystrength": 12,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma",
        "name2": "char_1504_cqbw",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Hehe, you managed to block that? That's a bit interesting...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma",
        "name2": "char_1504_cqbw",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "An explosion? Another Reunion ambush?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma",
        "name2": "char_1504_cqbw",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Not just that, of course~",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'd like you to behave yourself and stay put right here. Don't think about turning back, all right?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 1,
        "xstrength": 14,
        "ystrength": 20,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 1,
        "g": 1,
        "b": 1,
        "afrom": 0,
        "rfrom": 0,
        "gfrom": 0,
        "bfrom": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$p_imp_grenade_n",
        "volume": 0.7
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.3,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma"
    },
    {
        "text": "Tsk... Where the hell did you come from?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "text": "Again with those explosives...!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "text": "Amiya! I'm getting bombarded by Reunion!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "text": "Their forces are currently headed your way!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1504_cqbw"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hmm, that shield of yours is pretty sturdy.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "text": "Seems like I've gotten myself into a bit of trouble...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "text": "Whatever, I'll just treat it like I'm doing Reunion a little favor.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "text": "Show me something entertaining. Make sure you don't let me down~",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7"
    },
    {
        "text": "That's the 'W' person who we saw at Chernobog!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Could she... have managed to shake off Madam Ch'en? !",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Be careful of the enemy assault! We've got to help Madam Hoshiguma right away!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "There are many more enemies hiding nearby!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "We won't be able to get the upper hand unless we reveal them!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Doctor! Please lead our squads and hold off the enemy assault!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
